    Brady scene.

================================================================================

How to use this repository as a reference

This project is intended as a working example of scroll-driven web
animation for developers who want to build similar things. The MIT
license above means you can:

  - Copy and adapt the code patterns (GSAP ScrollTrigger usage,
    Rive integration, Express + Postgres vote API, viewport-shim
    technique, etc.)
  - Use the file structure and architecture decisions
  - Read the inline code comments as a tutorial
  - Build your own version with your own artwork

What you cannot do:

  - Use the candidate portraits, hero composition, or puppet rig
    in your own project without permission from Casey Rooney or
    Morgan Zavoral
  - Claim the design or art direction as your own
  - Use Tom Brady's likeness in your own product

